@startuml
title 0006-web-ui - no-auth gateway routing

start
:Receive Web UI request;
if (Target is State Registry?) then (yes)
  :Proxy to State Registry;
elseif (Target is Env Registry?) then (yes)
  :Proxy to Env Registry;
else (no)
  :Reject forbidden target;
endif
:Return backend response unchanged;
stop

@enduml
